  "humanDescription": "Different-species parents may yield a hybrid larva. An optional Research Disc improves the odds; each attempt consumes both bees and the disc. ^blue;Outputs: 1 active, 2 disc, 3 larva, 4 ready.^reset;",
  "apexDescription": "Genetic experimentation with poor odds. A Research Disc improves them, but each attempt consumes both specimens and the disc. ^blue;Outputs: 1 active, 2 disc, 3 larva, 4 ready.^reset;",
  "avianDescription": "Two bee lineages meet here. A Research Disc may help a queen larva emerge; neither parent nor the disc survives the attempt. ^blue;Outputs: 1 active, 2 disc, 3 larva, 4 ready.^reset;",
  "floranDescription": "Machine mixesss different beesss. Research Disc help shifty odds. Eatsss both beesss and disc every try. ^blue;Outputs: 1 active, 2 disc, 3 larva, 4 ready.^reset;",
  "glitchDescription": "Cautionary. Different-species parents may yield a hybrid larva. Research Discs boost success; both bees and the disc are consumed per attempt. ^blue;Outputs: 1 active, 2 disc, 3 larva, 4 ready.^reset;",
  "hylotlDescription": "A troubling union of bee lineages. A Research Disc improves its chance, yet each attempt sacrifices both parents and the disc. ^blue;Outputs: 1 active, 2 disc, 3 larva, 4 ready.^reset;",
  "novakidDescription": "Put in a queen, a drone and maybe a Research Disc. Better odds with the disc; the rig uses 'em all each try. ^blue;Outputs: 1 active, 2 disc, 3 larva, 4 ready.^reset;",
  "genericDescription": "Different-species parents and power drive the experiment. An optional Research Disc boosts success odds and is consumed on every attempt; both bees are consumed too. ^blue;Outputs: 1 active, 2 disc, 3 larva, 4 ready.^reset;"
